values:
Pronounced "lo" - notice the vowel marker; 
Can also be used before verbs to negate them, as an equivalent of “did not”/”does not”/”do not” etc.

Examples: לֹא גָדָלְתִי = I did not grow. הוּא לֹא לוֹמֵד = he does not learn.

